A||N||10||Marc Harris||Quick Intro||||1||
Z||000000||Marc Harris||11-12-2001||01:11 AM||||I've been lurking in this excellent forum for a couple of weeks and wanted to quickly introduce myself. <P>I'm the original owner of an '87 4 cyl. that has 70K miles. Five years ago the cooling fan motor quit working and while I was preparing to fix it, someone broke one of the door windows. It was rainy season so I parked it in the garage and didn't touch it until a few weeks ago.<P>I dusted it off, replaced the battery and started it up and it ran so well I decided to start restoring it cosmetically. It was my first car and I did some stupid kid things to it back then but it shouldn't take much to get it back to stock.<P>Anyway, I've had some fun times in this car and hopefully I'll be able to contribute to this group!  Thanks for reading.<P>Marc Harris<BR>San Jose, CA||||reg||1
Z||000001||72vinman||11-12-2001||01:15 AM||||Welcome, You will find the answers to all your questions here. Post some pics when you get a chance.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin1_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
